<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-17063] .NET: Failed to load libjvm.so in some environments</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17063</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We rely on &quot;readlink -f /usr/bin/java&quot; to locate the JVM on Linux.&lt;br/&gt;
However, in some cases &quot;readlink&quot; is not in PATH and this fails.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Try full path &quot;/usr/bin/readlink&quot; as well as short path&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Capture stderr when running commands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
